<title>UK: INTERVIEW - GA plans to sell Puerto Rico unit.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW - GA plans to sell Puerto Rico unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK composite insurer General Accident Plc said on Tuesday it plans to sell its business in Puerto Rico by the end of this year as part of efforts to refocus the group's portfolio.</p>
</text>
